{"kind": "constraint", "id": "bf16-grads-needs-pao", "scope": {"framework": "megatron", "versions.framework": ">=0.13,<0.14"}, "when": {"bf16_main_grads": "bf16", "precision_aware_optimizer": "off"}, "symptom": "crash", "message": "main_grads_dtype can only be fp32 when not using precision-aware optimizer", "fix": "add --use-precision-aware-optimizer"}
{"kind": "constraint", "id": "fp8-mock-loss", "scope": {"framework": "megatron", "workload.data": "mock"}, "when": {"precision": "fp8_delayed"}, "symptom": "invalid", "message": "window-mean loss 21-146 % off the bf16 reference in 30 updates on mock data (3 % tolerance)", "fix": "judge FP8 on real data or a longer run"}
{"kind": "rule", "id": "noise", "scope": {"gpu": ["H200-141GB"], "nodes": 1}, "text": "An idle 8-GPU H200-class node has a between-run noise of about 0.1 % (sigma_pair 0.10-0.14 %): single paired runs resolve 0.3 % gains; a Plackett-Burman design's unused columns overstate the noise 7x when large factors interact.", "confidence": "high", "evidence": ["ref", "combo"]}
{"kind": "constraint", "id": "ce-te-invalid", "scope": {"framework": "megatron", "versions.framework": ">=0.13,<0.14"}, "when": {"fused_cross_entropy": "on", "cross_entropy_fusion_impl": "te"}, "symptom": "invalid", "message": "window-mean loss 113-185 % off the reference (TE 2.3, mock data)", "fix": "keep --cross-entropy-fusion-impl native"}
{"kind": "constraint", "id": "empty-cache-slow", "scope": {"framework": "megatron"}, "when": {"empty_unused_memory": "1"}, "symptom": "slow", "message": "torch.cuda.empty_cache() every update: 40-110 % slower (8B, H200-class)", "fix": "leave --empty-unused-memory-level at 0 unless memory fragmentation is the bottleneck"}
